# Store LF in the repository and check out LF on every platform, so
# Windows and Linux contributors produce identical bytes and the
# pre-commit hooks behave the same everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary USD formats: crate files and zip packages. Plain .usd files
# may be either crate or text, so they are treated as binary too.
*.usd binary
*.usdc binary
*.usdz binary
